<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1351926923"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1452723960"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Connect (From &quot;Madoka Magica&quot;)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="AmaLee"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Nostalgia VI"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:02.880"><div begin="00:01.130" end="04:02.880"><p begin="00:01.130" end="00:03.040" itunes:key="L1">I will not forget the promise I made with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以下歌词翻译由文曲大模型提供</span></p><p begin="00:03.040" end="00:06.240" itunes:key="L2">I swear that I'll always keep it with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我发誓永远铭记于心</span></p><p begin="00:06.240" end="00:07.390" itunes:key="L3">I close my eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闭上双眼 回忆涌现</span></p><p begin="00:07.390" end="00:22.190" itunes:key="L4">And the memory clears the darkness clouding my way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱散前路的阴霾</span></p><p begin="00:22.190" end="00:27.290" itunes:key="L5">The future blinked away so fast before our eyes</p><p begin="00:27.290" end="00:33.970" itunes:key="L6">Will we ever get the chance to redeem that too-early goodbye?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能否能有机会挽回过早的告别</span></p><p begin="00:33.970" end="00:38.160" itunes:key="L7">Within this world, so full of fear, we find ourselves<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这充满恐惧的世界里</span></p><p begin="00:38.160" end="00:40.840" itunes:key="L8">Breaking through the dark of night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过黑暗之夜尝试打破我们的魔咒</span></p><p begin="00:40.840" end="00:44.240" itunes:key="L9">Each time it tries to break our spell<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们破开黑夜前行</span></p><p begin="00:44.240" end="00:50.240" itunes:key="L10">And with everyday time is ticking by<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随着时光流逝</span></p><p begin="00:50.240" end="00:55.630" itunes:key="L11">And it won't turn back no matter how I try<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论如何挽留 它绝不回头</span></p><p begin="00:55.630" end="01:00.580" itunes:key="L12">But within our heart, our love's never to break<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但在我们心底</span></p><p begin="01:00.580" end="01:02.190" itunes:key="L13">So let's unlock the door<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们推开那扇门 唤醒所有梦想</span></p><p begin="01:02.190" end="01:05.810" itunes:key="L14">And let all of our dreams awake</p><p begin="01:05.810" end="01:07.540" itunes:key="L15">My heart's racing on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心跳加速奔涌</span></p><p begin="01:07.540" end="01:09.410" itunes:key="L16">'Cause I wanna see the future<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我渴望看见未来</span></p><p begin="01:09.410" end="01:12.180" itunes:key="L17">And in my dreams, I see it with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在梦中我与你并肩同行</span></p><p begin="01:12.180" end="01:14.670" itunes:key="L18">The road ahead I know that it won't be easy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前路坎坷我深知不易</span></p><p begin="01:14.670" end="01:16.770" itunes:key="L19">But I'll fight through<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我必将披荆斩棘</span></p><p begin="01:16.770" end="01:18.170" itunes:key="L20">That blue sky above<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空依旧蔚蓝</span></p><p begin="01:18.170" end="01:21.230" itunes:key="L21">I know it will always wait for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那片湛蓝晴空</span></p><p begin="01:21.230" end="01:24.110" itunes:key="L22">So there is no reason to be afraid<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以无需畏惧</span></p><p begin="01:24.110" end="01:27.130" itunes:key="L23">'Cause the light inside my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因心中光芒永不熄灭</span></p><p begin="01:27.130" end="01:39.800" itunes:key="L24">Will never fade</p><p begin="01:39.800" end="01:41.320" itunes:key="L25">When I look back<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回首往昔岁月</span></p><p begin="01:41.320" end="01:44.640" itunes:key="L26">I see my friends are always there<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挚友始终相伴身旁</span></p><p begin="01:44.640" end="01:46.940" itunes:key="L27">All at once I feel the warmth<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想的温度骤然涌现</span></p><p begin="01:46.940" end="01:50.850" itunes:key="L28">From the dreams and memories we share<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和我们共有的记忆中感到温暖</span></p><p begin="01:50.850" end="01:55.420" itunes:key="L29">Although this world's distorted far beyond repair<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使这世界已支离破碎</span></p><p begin="01:55.420" end="01:58.760" itunes:key="L30">Here with you, there is a place I can be free<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你同在之处</span></p><p begin="01:58.760" end="02:01.590" itunes:key="L31">From those nightmares<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便是逃离梦魇的港湾</span></p><p begin="02:01.590" end="02:03.660" itunes:key="L32">Every day we share<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一天我们都携手同行</span></p><p begin="02:03.660" end="02:06.590" itunes:key="L33">All our feelings grow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的情感在生长</span></p><p begin="02:06.590" end="02:12.680" itunes:key="L34">Through the laugh and joy and even the sorrow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">历经爱与欢愉 甚至悲伤</span></p><p begin="02:12.680" end="02:14.660" itunes:key="L35">If I call your name<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若呼唤你的名字</span></p><p begin="02:14.660" end="02:17.490" itunes:key="L36">I know you will hear my voice<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道你会听见我的声音</span></p><p begin="02:17.490" end="02:22.540" itunes:key="L37">If you don't believe in a miracle it won't come true<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若不相信奇迹 它便不会成真</span></p><p begin="02:22.540" end="02:24.220" itunes:key="L38">I will not forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会忘记与你许下的誓言</span></p><p begin="02:24.220" end="02:26.020" itunes:key="L39">The promise I made with you</p><p begin="02:26.020" end="02:28.790" itunes:key="L40">I swear that I'll always keep it with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我发誓永远铭记于心</span></p><p begin="02:28.790" end="02:31.680" itunes:key="L41">I close my eyes and the memory clears the darkness<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闭上双眼 回忆涌现</span></p><p begin="02:31.680" end="02:33.950" itunes:key="L42">Clouding my way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱散前路的阴霾</span></p><p begin="02:33.950" end="02:38.060" itunes:key="L43">Even if a wall's so tall that it's blocking out the sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使高墙蔽日遮天</span></p><p begin="02:38.060" end="02:40.250" itunes:key="L44">I'll reach up and over it, I will fly<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也将振翅飞越山巅</span></p><p begin="02:40.250" end="02:44.240" itunes:key="L45">It's our promise to survive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以生死相许的誓言为约</span></p><p begin="02:44.240" end="03:18.300" itunes:key="L46">That I'll live by</p><p begin="03:18.300" end="03:21.270" itunes:key="L47">Wandering within the wreckage<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">徘徊在这破碎世界的残垣间</span></p><p begin="03:21.270" end="03:24.220" itunes:key="L48">And ruins of this broken world</p><p begin="03:24.220" end="03:31.680" itunes:key="L49">Something called my name and lead me to where I found you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冥冥中有呼唤指引方向</span></p><p begin="03:31.680" end="03:32.930" itunes:key="L50">My heart's racing on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心跳加速奔涌</span></p><p begin="03:32.930" end="03:35.180" itunes:key="L51">'Cause I wanna see the future<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我渴望看见未来</span></p><p begin="03:35.180" end="03:37.420" itunes:key="L52">And in my dreams, I see it with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只愿与你一同见证</span></p><p begin="03:37.420" end="03:40.140" itunes:key="L53">The road ahead, I know that it won't be easy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前路坎坷我深知不易</span></p><p begin="03:40.140" end="03:42.320" itunes:key="L54">But I'll fight through<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我必将披荆斩棘</span></p><p begin="03:42.320" end="03:43.620" itunes:key="L55">That blue sky above<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那片湛蓝晴空</span></p><p begin="03:43.620" end="03:46.260" itunes:key="L56">I know it will always wait for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远为我守候</span></p><p begin="03:46.260" end="03:49.460" itunes:key="L57">So there is no reason to be afraid<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以无需畏惧</span></p><p begin="03:49.460" end="03:52.450" itunes:key="L58">'Cause the light inside my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因心中光芒永不熄灭</span></p><p begin="03:52.450" end="03:56.020" itunes:key="L59">Will never fade</p><p begin="03:56.020" end="04:02.880" itunes:key="L60">I'll always look ahead<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将永远向前看</span></p></div></body></tt>